{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44685","headline":"三不爲篇 二 · 海顺","name":"三不爲篇 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我欲刺股锥刃，悬头屋梁。\n书临雪彩，牒映萤光。\n一朝鹏举，万里鸾翔。\n纵任才辩，游说君王。\n高车反邑，衣锦还乡。\n将恐鸟残以羽，兰折由芳。\n笼餐讵贵，钩饵难尝。\n是以高巢林薮，深穴池塘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"海顺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_44685.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_44685","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}